<title>USA: TENNIS-HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT, Rhode Island 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$255,000 Hall of Fame Championships grass court tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>7-Leander Paes (India) beat 1-Alex Radulescu (Germany) 6-3 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>5-Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) beat 4-Sandon Stolle (Australia)</p>
<p>6-3 7-5</p>
